OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day on Sunday and feeling
OL,6,Fvery warm in the sunny spells. Some
OL,7,Fpatchy cloud developing in the
OL,8,Fafternoon, but still plenty of
OL,9,Fsunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FTurning increasingly cloudy
OL,12,Ffrom the west during the evening with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of light and patchy rain
OL,14,Fpushing across the region during the
OL,15,Fearly hours.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FTurning rather warm and humid
OL,18,Fon Monday with an increasing chance of
OL,19,Fshowers during the afternoon, these
OL,20,Fbecoming more frequent and heavier
OL,21,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
